<li>Studies in Memory of Israel Abrahams (New York: Jewish Institute of Religion, 1927).</li>
<li>Rabbinic Literature and Gospel Teachings (London: Macmillan, 1930).</li>
<li>The Synoptic Gospels (New York: K.T.A.V. Publishing House, 1968), with ‘Prolegomenon’ by Lou H Silberman.</li>
